  "description": "Controlled I2I-budget scaling, six recipes and four generation budgets.",
  "notes": [
    "Figure scaling panel b. Baseline is trained once per task/seed and reused across plot budgets.",
    "Fixed seed-42 stage-1 checkpoint is shared by stage-2 seeds42/123/456; R2 and R6 reuse the same unfrozen stage1.",
    "R3 preserves the historical single optimizer across Mixed and I2T phases; the paper appendix instead describes a reset for multi-stage recipes.",
    "R4 stage 1 trains generation-specific parameters while freezing understanding and shared parameters; stage 2 trains Mixed with the standard trainable parameters.",
    "These are executable protocol presets, not a claim of newly reproduced scores or currently downloadable historical checkpoints."
